<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 4.3 percent in the week ended February 21, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>    Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 10.8 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages increased 1.9 percent.     The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 38.5 percent to 556.0 from 401.5 the previous week.</p>
<p>    The purchase index rose 22.7 percent to 205.3 in the latest survey from 167.3 in the previous week.</p>
